  data: {
    LLM: "Bid on long suits (5+ cards) with high honors (A, K). Count trumps played. Support partner if they bid.\n\nLead trumps early to clear opponents' trumps if you are declarer. If defending, try to force declarer to ruff (use trumps) when they are weak.\n\nSignal partner with discards (high/low). Calculate 'losing tricks' to estimate bid. Squeeze opponents in end-game.",
